{"id": 359390, "slug": "neon-tail", "name": "Neon Tail", "name_original": "Neon Tail", "description": "<strong>Save your city from dimensional disaster !</strong><br/>You are a rising SFS Pro star, who acquired mysterious powers from a powerful being.<br/>Use your agility and wits to stop the invasion of cross-dimensional creatures!<br/><br/><br/><strong>Explore BluePulse city!</strong><br/>Take small jobs, go shopping, relax in restaurants and cafes, and earn fame and fortune by becoming a Skate for Street Pro star player!<br/><br/><br/><strong>Roller Skating Physics!</strong><br/>Master the new roller skating physics and become so precise no crazy jumps will resist you!<br/><br/><br/><strong>Meet colorful and interesting people!</strong><br/>The world of Neon Tail is filled with interesting people, time to make many friends!<br/><br/><br/><strong>Take care of your camera Drone</strong><br/>Visit Drone shops to upgrade or install extensible modules on your camera drone Modulo. Scanners, Maps, HUD, Photographs, Flashlights, Codex, etc...<br/><br/><br/><strong>Learn about mysterious powers!</strong><br/>On your adventures, you will meet Telopern, an extra dimensional godlike creature. He will give you strange powers that you will need to master to save your dimension!<br/><br/><br/><strong>Save Bluepulse City!</strong><br/>Use your agility, dexterity, wits, reputation, friendships, and powers to save your city from a dimensional disaster!", "metacritic": null, "metacritic_platforms": [], "released": "2018-10-31", "tba": false, "updated": "2020-02-20T12:02:50", "background_image": "https://media.rawg.io/media/screenshots/88c/88ce8822d7085d1dafc0253755fdd21f.jpg", "background_image_additional": "https://media.rawg.io/media/screenshots/080/0806215cde24f25cfd217373cac7589f.jpg", "website": "https://rocketjuicegames.com/", "rating": 0.0, "rating_top": 0, "ratings": [], "reactions": {}, "added": 12, "added_by_status": {"yet": 1, "owned": 10, "toplay": 1}, "playtime": 1, "s